{"tournament": {"id": 12659633, "name": "Kards Open XV - Top 16", "url": "3on9ib8g", "description": "<p style=\"max-height: none; overflow: hidden; padding: 0px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">STAGE TWO\u00a0- If you finish in the Top 8 from either stage weekend, you will be qualified for the next stage - Saturday, March 18th to compete in the single elimination best of 5 conquest.\u00a0\u00a0In the top 16, participants play a Single Elimination bracket with closed deck lists in a best of 5 series. However, each win must be with a deck from a different main nation.</p><p>STAGE THREE\u00a0- In the top 4, players submit 4 decks from different main nations and continue to play a Single Elimination bracket, in a best of 5 series, on Sunday March 19th. This final part of the Open is played with open deck lists.</p><p><span style='color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: \"Chakra Petch\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.01em;'><br>PRIZE POOL</span><br></p><p>1st: $600 USD<br>2nd: $450 USD<br>3rd: $250 USD<br>4th: $200 USD<br>5th-8th: 500 Diamonds and 2000 Gold<br>9th-16th: 200 Diamonds and 1000 Gold<br></p><h4>FORMAT &amp; SCHEDULE</h4><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">Top Cuts</p><ul>\r\n<li><p>Bring four decks from four different main nations</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 16 conquest format best of 5 with closed deck lists</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 16 Bracket March 18th\u00a0@ 1300 GMT<br></p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 4 Bracket &amp; Live Stream March 19th @ 1300 GMT</p></li>\r\n</ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">Kards Open Full Rules and Regulations:\u00a0<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_uYNermUzVIdr4K9RwrAI2mKhDlQTWp-oKqRzRA8iso/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://support.kards.com/hc/en-us/articles/8712237212697-KARDS-Tournament-Official-Rules</a></p