art of the Open is played with open deck lists.</p><p><span style='color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: \"Chakra Petch\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.01em;'><br>PRIZE POOL</span><br></p><p>1st: $600 USD<br>2nd: $450 USD<br>3rd: $250 USD<br>4th: $200 USD<br>5th-8th: 500 Diamonds and 2000 Gold<br>9th-16th: 200 Diamonds and 1000 Gold<br></p><h4>FORMAT &amp; SCHEDULE</h4><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">Top Cuts</p><ul>\r\n<li><p>Bring four decks from four different main nations</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 16 conquest format best of 5 with closed deck lists</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 16 Bracket March 18th\u00a0@ 1300 GMT<br></p></li>\r\n<li><p>Top 4 Bracket &amp; Live Stream March 19th @ 1300 GMT</p></li>\r\n</ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1.6rem;\">Kards Open Full Rules and Regulations:\u00a0<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_uYNermUzVIdr4K9RwrAI2mKhDlQTWp-oKqRzRA8iso/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://support.kards.com/hc/en-us/articles/8712237212697-KARDS-Tournament-Official-Rules</a></p><ul>\r\n<li><p>The Kards Esports Discord will be the main hub of communication with the tournament admins. This is the required method for contacting an admin if you have questions or a match dispute:\u00a0<a href=\"https://discord.gg/288DQexmng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/288DQexmng</a></p></li>\r\n<li><p>For Chinese players who can not access Discord, there is a Wechat group for tournament communication. Contact: 003546614978</p></li>\r\n</ul><p style=\"margin-top: 10px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(187, 187, 187); background-color: rgb(50, 54, 65);\">Hide Full Description</p>", "subdomain": null, "full_challonge_url": "https://challonge.com/3on9ib8g", "live_image_url": "https://challonge.com/3on9ib8g.svg", "sign_up_url": null, "review_before_finalizing": true, "accepting_predictions": false, "participants_locked": true, "game_name": "Kards: The World War II Collectible Card Game", "participants_swappable": false, "team_convertable": false, "group_stages_were_started": false}, "kards_meta": {"url": "https://challonge.com/3on9ib8g", "title": "Kards Open XV - Top 16", "category": "open", "event": "", "stage": ""}}